+## 2026-11-19 independent replay
+
+The v1.0 baseline and archived run files are preserved. C1, C2, the revised C3 (called C3′ in the follow-up request), and C4 were replayed one at a time against v1.0. C1+C4 was also replayed to check the existing v1.1 configuration. The [score report](SCORE.md) records the outcomes and [the evaluation table](evidence/confirmed_evaluation_2026-11-19.md) shows both blind and corrected development-set counts. Held-out measurement is pending.
+
+The shortlist's label for new-grad fit and the filter's posting decision answer different questions. The Pre-training role passed v1.1 even though the Codex level review found the posting unclear about new-grad fit. C3′ would abstain, but the student's posting-level audit labeled this role relevant. This illustrates the cost of treating every unknown level as a reason to hide a posting.
